    "analysis": "Soup (soup-cli) is a Python CLI that fine-tunes and post-trains LLMs from a single YAML config, covering SFT, DPO, GRPO and other methods with LoRA/QLoRA. Its layer-streaming mode keeps frozen weights out of VRAM so an 8B model can train on a 4 GB laptop GPU. It also provides data cleaning, evaluation, adapter checks, GGUF/Ollama export, inference and a web UI. Aimed at solo builders with consumer GPUs; built on PyTorch, transformers, peft and trl, with extensive benchmark records.",
